# Use an authenticated workspace-admin session and its CSRF token.
@origin = http://localhost:3000
@workspace = REPLACE_WORKSPACE_UUID
@request = REPLACE_REQUEST_UUID
@cookie = repodesk_session=REPLACE_SESSION
@csrf = REPLACE_CSRF

### Unified Members & access page uses this policy with member profiles
# members include optional name, username and profileUpdatedAt display metadata.
# Old approved requests provide a fallback; unknown users still have numeric IDs.
GET {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/access-policy
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Paginated member API also includes the available Telegram profiles
GET {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/members?offset=0
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Pending requests, current policy version, and shareable Telegram link
GET {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/access-requests
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Approve as a regular member; use the GET response's version
POST {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/access-requests/{{request}}/decision
Cookie: {{cookie}}
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision":"approved","version":2}

### Reject without granting membership or whitelist access
POST {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/access-requests/{{request}}/decision
Cookie: {{cookie}}
Origin: {{origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision":"rejected","version":2}
